<div class="d-flex flex-column gap-2" style="padding: 12px;">
  <p class="mb-notes">
    <i class="fas fa-info-circle"></i>
    Only actors where <strong>all non-GM players have Owner permission</strong> are valid choices.
    Invalid actors are shown but cannot be saved. To fix: open the actor sheet &rarr; Configure &rarr; Permissions &rarr; set all players to <em>Owner</em>.
  </p>

  <div class="form-group">
    <label for="partyActorId">Party Actor</label>
    <select name="partyActorId" id="partyActorId">
      <option value="">— None —</option>
      {{#each actors as |actor|}}
        <option value="{{actor.id}}"
          {{#if actor.selected}}selected{{/if}}
          {{#unless actor.isValid}}data-invalid="true"{{/unless}}>
          {{actor.name}}{{#unless actor.isValid}} ⚠ (missing Owner for some players){{/unless}}
        </option>
      {{/each}}
    </select>
  </div>

  <div class="d-flex gap-2" style="justify-content: flex-end; margin-top: 8px;">
    <button type="submit" class="mb-btn-primary">
      <i class="fas fa-save"></i> Save
    </button>
  </div>
</div>
